flowchart TD
    observed[Observer returns typed outcomes]
    review[Review each outcome against the brief]
    result{Aggregate review result}
    pause[One AWAITING_OWNER pause]
    answered{All requested decisions answered}
    ready[READY_TO_RESUME]
    retry[One fresh coding attempt]
    observeAgain[Observer checks regenerated artifact]
    verify{Every expected outcome matches}
    completeFirst[COMPLETED]
    failedReview[FAILED]
    completeSecond[COMPLETED]
    failedRetry[FAILED]

    observed --> review
    review --> result
    result -->|Contradicted| failedReview
    result -->|All supported| completeFirst
    result -->|Answers required| pause
    pause --> answered
    answered -->|No| pause
    answered -->|Yes| ready
    ready --> retry
    retry --> observeAgain
    observeAgain --> verify
    verify -->|Yes| completeSecond
    verify -->|No| failedRetry
